    "notes": "underscore DoS via _.flatten/_.isEqual recursion. Reachable only via json-merger in config/configMigrator.js, which consumes the packaged template + root-owned /etc/armor/config.yaml (no attacker-controllable input). jsonpath 1.3.0 still pins underscore 1.13.6 internally; the two other jsonpath advisories (GHSA-6c59-mwgh-r2x6 prototype pollution and GHSA-87r5-mp6g-5w5j unsafe eval) were resolved in jsonpath 1.3.0 and have been removed from this allowlist.",
    "expiry": "2027-04-22"
  }
